{"id":"expl:packages/cli/src/runtime.ts@L111","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":111,"end":111}},"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":111,"end":111},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:c8eab2b6599470343df760cde97d4facfbcec340dea026d3ed34b25fa90919c3","meta":{"text":"Back-compat shim: `isIndexed(repoRoot)` for callers that only know the work-tree root."}}
{"id":"expl:packages/cli/src/runtime.ts@L116","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":116,"end":124}},"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":116,"end":124},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:8f51790670f10abda10380cb0f73de11fe4cef02d71e8cdf5d0bb97d10f43262","meta":{"text":"Build the IndexStore from the soul, persisting it to the manifest's declared index path.\nThe manifest path (`.crib/index/crib.sqlite`) is **repo-root-relative** by convention. When\n`cribDir === <repoRoot>/.crib` (the standard layout) it resolves against `repoRoot` as before.\nWhen the registry has redirected `cribDir` to a custom location, the index lives *inside* that\n`cribDir` (it's a derived artifact of the soul, so it travels with it) — the leading `.crib/` is\nstripped so the path lands at `<cribDir>/index/crib.sqlite`. Absolute manifest paths are honored."}}
{"id":"expl:packages/cli/src/runtime.ts@L155","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":155,"end":159}},"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":155,"end":159},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:60a7db3fb20c4826196fab3d4212555fb641ed6de3894d3ba17dfdb747ba1d72","meta":{"text":"Open the derived IndexStore WITHOUT rebuilding from the soul (M6 incremental path). Used by\n`crib update`, which mutates the soul then applies an `IndexDelta` to the existing index. Throws if\nno index exists yet (run `crib index` first)."}}
{"id":"expl:packages/cli/src/runtime.ts@L174","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":174,"end":174}},"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":174,"end":174},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:88251617e0f76960c1b6bf337167c582416238bfafdd19f464486dc8c5d018c9","meta":{"text":"Resolve a manifest index path (repo-root-relative by convention) to an absolute on-disk path."}}
{"id":"expl:packages/cli/src/runtime.ts@L48","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":48,"end":52}},"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":48,"end":52},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:496047ac9bad771a8f408cd2d54b17e69ac4e88fe2634bec1edc25d73987259b","meta":{"text":"Resolve the project root + soul directory per the priority chain above. Never throws — a miss\nreturns `{ repoRoot: <candidate>, cribDir: <candidate>/.crib }` so the caller's `isIndexedRoot`\ncheck produces the familiar \"not indexed\" error rather than a crash."}}
{"id":"expl:packages/cli/src/runtime.ts@L86","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":86,"end":86}},"file":"packages/cli/src/runtime.ts","span":{"start":86,"end":86},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:31481cd204fa95a93664f9818f11696e409c33f70cfecfd1fbce9ffa10ae64f5","meta":{"text":"Walk upward from `start` returning the first dir containing `.crib/crib.json`, else `undefined`."}}
